            <ArticleTitle>Rehabilitation of the osteoarthritic patient: focus on the knee.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reviews the factors involved in the rehabilitation process of the knee. Use of patient education, pain management, restoration of range of motion, and strengthening within the foundation of an aerobic fitness program are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
